{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_town004_kanban_01",
      "hash": "b51317a8f3060e71",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是華藍市\\n華藍即是神秘莫測的水藍之色"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_town004_kanban_02",
      "hash": "b51314a8f3060958",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……有用的告示板！\\c\\n在進化途中按下Ｂ鍵，\\n進化就會停止。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_town004_kanban_03",
      "hash": "b51315a8f3060b0b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "自行車愛好者的家"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_town004_kanban_04",
      "hash": "b5131aa8f306138a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "華藍市寶可夢道館\\n館主小霞\\r\\n俏皮的人魚"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_town004_adultm_01",
      "hash": "974467edc6eb5151",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也是個訓練家？\\n既要到處收集寶可夢，又要去戰鬥，\\r\\n要幹的事太多了，真不容易呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_town004_youngm_01_01",
      "hash": "39c978ef1accc119",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "店的前面長了棵樹，\\n害我都過不去對面啦。\\c\\n不過，從某個地方繞道的話\\n似乎就能過去……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_boya1_01_p02_field_t004",
      "hash": "6dbca59f00f65f78",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_town004_middlem_01",
      "hash": "3a702dc61ba863a4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哦哦……！\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在收集寶可夢圖鑑嗎？\\r\\n好像挺有趣的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_town004_policef_01",
      "hash": "eedfa2d161c67198",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這家人被小偷光顧了！\\c\\n根據目擊者的口供，\\n犯人是……火箭隊！\\c\\n為了保護受害人的安全，\\n這陣子禁止任何人進入這裡！\\r\\n就算只是一隻小拉達也不行！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_town004_youngf_01_01",
      "hash": "89c3f2c67ed7bf0c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "去吧頑皮雷彈！\\n使出音爆吧！\\c\\n……雷彈啊，\\n你聽聽我的指示好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_town004_youngf_01_02",
      "hash": "89c3f5c67ed7c425",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈！那裡要用撞擊！\\n唉……又失敗了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_town004_youngf_01_03",
      "hash": "89c3f4c67ed7c272",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈！使出高速星星！\\n啊……不是啦～！\\r\\n寶可夢真難控制！\\c\\n牠們聽不聽從指示，\\n都要看訓練家的本事呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_01_01",
      "hash": "bbf3f6e0c799a43b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈在睡午覺……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_01_02",
      "hash": "bbf3f7e0c799a5ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈在偷懶……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_01_03",
      "hash": "bbf3f8e0c799a7a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈別過了頭！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_01_04",
      "hash": "bbf3f9e0c799a954",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "頑皮雷彈裝作什麼都聽不懂……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_town004_childf_01",
      "hash": "0333cfa13f0b2060",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "那家的大哥哥……\\c\\n聽說他在收集\\n世界上各種類型的自行車呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_trainerm1_01_p01_field_t004",
      "hash": "424b20fd31d344f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "這裡是……華藍洞窟！\\n裡面棲息著\\r\\n強得可怕的寶可夢喔！\\c\\n只有得到寶可夢聯盟認證的\\n冠軍才有資格進去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_town004_fat_01",
      "hash": "9b47f4cb990902d1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 18]"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_02_01",
      "hash": "1259bee863036144",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 19]"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_town004_miniskirt_01",
      "hash": "a554ab1074d15de6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 20]"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_town004_poke_03",
      "hash": "da1f26e2db35d5ad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 21]"
    },
